==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
{{affix|en|pharmaco-|-logy}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˌfɑrməˈkɒlədʒi/|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-}}

# {{context|medicine|lang=en}} The science of drugs including their origin, composition, [[pharmacokinetics]], therapeutic use, and [[toxicology]].
# {{context|medicine|lang=en}} The properties and reactions of drugs especially with relation to their therapeutic value.

